{
  "name": "KSeF - Client Notifications",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0001-4000-a000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every 2 Hours - Offline24 Warnings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [260, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 */2 * * *" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-a000-000000000002",
      "name": "Call Notify Offline24",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [560, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://portal:3000/api/notify/offline24",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.NOTIFY_SECRET }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0003-4000-a000-000000000003",
      "name": "Weekly Monday 08:00 - Receivables Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [260, 460],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 8 * * 1" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0004-4000-a000-000000000004",
      "name": "Call Notify Receivables",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [560, 460],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://portal:3000/api/notify/receivables",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.NOTIFY_SECRET }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0005-4000-a000-000000000005",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 660],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0006-4000-a000-000000000006",
      "name": "Alert on Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [560, 660],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:5678/webhook/ksef-alert",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "keypair",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ severity: 'warning', message: 'Client Notifications workflow failed! Check execution logs.', workflow_name: 'KSeF - Client Notifications' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "neverError": true } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0007-4000-a000-000000000007",
      "name": "Workflow Purpose",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 80],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 160,
        "content": "## Client-facing notifications\n\nThe CLIENT-facing counterpart to 05-offline24-monitor.json's internal ops alerts, and to digest/route.ts's firm-internal daily digest — both of those tell the *firm's own staff* something; this tells the firm's *client* (the taxpayer) something.\n\n- Every 2h: offline24 deadline warnings (4h / 1h / overdue), matching 05's own urgency thresholds exactly. Emails clients.contact_email via /api/notify/offline24.\n- Weekly (Mon 08:00): a periodic, informational digest of each client's own overdue receivables via /api/notify/receivables — NOT a dunning notice to the invoice's buyer, who has no captured contact info anywhere in the schema.\n\nBoth routes are shared-secret protected (NOTIFY_SECRET), same convention as digest/route.ts."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0008-4000-a000-000000000008",
      "name": "Error Handling Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 600],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 140,
        "content": "## Error handling\n\nAs with every other workflow here, an Error Trigger node alone does nothing — n8n only invokes it once Settings -> Error Workflow points at this workflow's id. That's a one-time per-environment step (fresh ids on every import), documented in INSTALL.md alongside the same step for 04-ksef-invoice-retrieval.json.\n\nBoth HTTP Request nodes use onError: continueRegularOutput so one route failing (e.g. Resend not configured yet) doesn't block the other."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 2 Hours - Offline24 Warnings": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call Notify Offline24", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Weekly Monday 08:00 - Receivables Digest": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call Notify Receivables", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Error Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Alert on Error", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "Europe/Warsaw",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  }
}
